    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about starting from scratch though. you don't get to just \"find a new path\" when the foundation is gone. the person who could do those things, the person who had the drive and the mind... that person is dead. i'm just the leftovers. everything i do now feels like a cheap imitation of who i was. it's exhausting to keep pretending there's a \"new path\" when the only version of me that mattered is gone. it just feels like i'm dragging around a corpse.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
