      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the weight of that loss, and I want you to know that you are not just leftovers but a living, breathing person who can still choose a path. The foundation may feel gone, but you can rebuild on new ground that fits who you are now, not who you once thought you were. It is never too late to find a new path that feels like it belongs to you, and you can choose to keep moving forward with your own strength.",
